{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@3118","endTime":339037.461,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 17\nEs-Platform.\n\nA learning-platform dashboard presenting course records, summary cards, charts, and account access.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nLearning operations\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nBring course activity into one view.\n\nES-Platform’s artwork presents an information-rich dashboard rather than a promotional landing page. Summary cards and charts sit above recent-course records, with a persistent sidebar organizing the workspace. A separate sign-in interface provides the entry point into the platform.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Es-Platform's original project material.\n\n01\nSummary cards\n\nHigh-level information appears in a row of dashboard modules.\n\n02\nActivity charts\n\nChart panels give the workspace a visual summary area.\n\n03\nCourse records\n\nA recent-course table provides a more detailed information view.\n\n04\nSidebar navigation\n\nPersistent navigation organizes the platform’s sections.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nLearning operations\n\nBlue highlights, pale surfaces, and compact white cards structure the dashboard. The design uses clear visual separation between headline summaries, charted activity, and tabular records so that different information types can coexist on one screen.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Es-Platform.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n02\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n03\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n04\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nEs-Platform's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nEs-Platform / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nBeen There\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nSERVICES MARKETPLACE\nBeen There\nLEAD CAPTURE & FORMS\nLead Management\nSOCIAL & COMMUNITY\nLivSocial\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
